cstorms.1805","kind":"project","conditional":false,"delayed":false,"sourceKind":"project","source":"common/special_projects/03_projects_cosmic_storms.txt:571","hooks":["on_success"],"story":"event-cstorms-1800"}],"source":{"file":"common/special_projects/03_projects_cosmic_storms.txt","line":570}}],"summary":{"text":"# 风暴之眼 / Eye of the Storm\n\n- 分类 Category: C8 银河轶事 / C8 Galactic miscellany · 来源 Sources: events/cosmic_storms_events_1.txt:3800-4005; common/on_actions/00_on_actions.txt:5404-5417 · DLC: Cosmic Storms · 审阅 Reviewed 2026-10-13\n\n## 如何开始 How it starts\n\n风暴进入某个已被占有的星系时（on_storm_entered_system），有10%概率触发 cstorms.1800（非“暴风消退”标记的风暴，每个国家仅一次，国家类型为默认）。它把风暴锁定在原地并给玩家 cstorms.1801。\n\nWhen a storm enters an owned system (on_storm_entered_system) there is a 10% chance of cstorms.1800 (not for a stormfall storm, once per country, default country type). It locks the storm in place and shows cstorms.1801.\n\n## 剧情脉络 Story outline\n\ncstorms.1801“风暴之眼”：选项“好奇”启用对应风暴类型的“风暴之眼”特殊项目并给少量物理研究。项目完成后 cstorms.1805“进入漩涡”：科学船收集资源——磁暴得合金，天体风暴得矿物，虚境风暴得 Zro，联结风暴得多种资源，其余得能量；10%概率让领袖受创。\n\ncstorms.1801 \"Eye of the Storm\": the option \"Curious\" enables the \"Eye of the Storm\" special project for the storm type and grants a little physics research. When the project finishes cstorms.1805 \"Into the Vortex\": the science ship harvests resources - alloys from magnetic storms, minerals from celestial, Zro from shroud, several from nexus, energy otherwise; 10% chance the leader is traumatised.\n\n## 分支与结局 Branches and outcomes\n\n八种风暴类型各对应一个项目（互斥）；领袖创伤为10%随机。\n\nOne project per storm type (exclusive); leader trauma is a 10% roll.\n\n## 条件与文明差异 Conditions and variants\n\n需要 Cosmic Storms DLC。\n\nNeeds the Cosmic Storms DLC.\n\n## 审阅记录 Review notes\n\n- 已核对入口、触发、选项与结果。\n  Checked the entry, trigger, options and outcomes.\n- （以上为审阅者撰写的说明，不是游戏原文；原文见阅读页。）\n  (Commentary written by the reviewer, not game text; the original text is in the reader.)\n","path":"summaries/event-cstorms-1800.md"}}